    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d279">

                <pb facs="0454" n="412" xml:id="pg412"/>

                <head>Mr. Adams to Mr. Seward.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 488.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Legation of the United States</hi>,
                                <hi rendition="#italic">London</hi>,</placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1863-09-04"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >September</hi> 4, 1863.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> I transmit the copy of a note addressed by
                    me this day to Lord Russell, transmitting another deposition received from Mr.
                    Dudley, relating to the preparation for departure of the iron-clad ram from
                    Liverpool.</p>
                <p>I think that with this I have done all that falls within my province to prevent
                    the government here from permitting this injurious act. The responsibility for
                    the consequences of it must now, rest on them. From the terms of a leading
                    article in <hi rendition="#italic">The Globe</hi> of last evening, as well as
                    the printed answer of Lord Russell to the memorial of the Union and Emancipation
                    Committee, I much fear that they have fallen on the feeblest policy.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, sir, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>CHARLES FRANCIS ADAMS.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William H. Seward</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">Secretary of State, Washington, D. C.</hi></p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d279-a1.xml" xpointer="d279-a1"/>
